                                "sense_id": "ff52fd07-a6e4-393c-938f-29dc89295556",
                                "text": "“I remind myself,” McCleary says, unconvincingly, “that in medieval times, surgeons and dentists were classified under the sign of Mars along with butchers, barbers, tinkers, castrators of animals, murderers and hangmen.”"
